What:           /sys/devices/virtual/touch/tp_dev/double_tap
Date:           September 2026
Contact:        Xiaomi Crux kernel maintainers
Description:
                Write a boolean to enable or disable double tap to wake on the
                ST FTS touchscreen. The write updates only the double-tap
                gesture mask and applies the current touch mode. Other gesture
                bits are preserved. Invalid values, incompatible cover mode,
                and controller failures return an error to the caller.
                This interface does not use the legacy gesture_mask command
                staging buffer and does not require a subsequent read.
